                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Overall a fun hack and slash game so far (for less than $3), however there are issues that I wish were fixed:\n- When you die after you start a game with no prior checkpoint, you respawn in a glitched state and cannot move, and you might have to force quit the game.\n- Whenever you start a game, your costume resets back to default until you re-equip it in the \"Information\" menu.\n- Some translations aren't the best; Instead of \"Inventory\" menu, it is \"Information\" menu, Instead of \"Close\" in the shops, it is \"Disable\" etc.\n- The jump movement is a little janky as well; It is possible to jump a little too far.\n\nThe costume designs are really good, and this game has great potential, however it needs more polishing in order to be worth even close to its full asking price.",
